    {
      "sentence_id": 10,
      "text": "In the aforesaid circumstances, taking note of allegation against applicant as well as contents of dying declaration still considering that applicant is in jail since 11.12.2021 and present status of trial is not on record, therefore, in the interest of justice, even in absence of counsel for applicant, this application is disposed of with observation/direction that if trial is not substantially progressed within six months, applicant will have liberty to approach this Court after six months along with status of trial.",
